Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.58,Short,,0,0,0,,The moment you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:01.32,Short,,0,0,0,,scratch behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:02.06,Short,,0,0,0,,its ears
