Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.04,Short,,0,0,0,,birth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:10.80,Short,,0,0,0,,The sound comes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:11.44,Short,,0,0,0,,from the voice
