Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.24,Short,,0,0,0,,these low vibrations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.16,Short,,0,0,0,,might even help
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.32,Short,,0,0,0,,bones heal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:22.64,Short,,0,0,0,,But when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.24,Short,,0,0,0,,your cat is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:23.86,Short,,0,0,0,,hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:24.20,Short,,0,0,0,,it hides
